# Air / build output
tmp/
bin/

# Static gallery export (`make site`) — rebuilt on tag, published to
# GitHub Pages, never committed.
/site/

# Local env
.env

# dist/ is deliberately NOT ignored: it is committed so that Go consumers can
# embed the bundles with //go:embed and `go get` the module without a build
# step. `make verify` fails if it drifts from the sources.
